&lt;b&gt;(Source: Heroes of the street)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;b&gt;&#201;cole&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Pr&#233;sentation-Des-Sorts#Abjuration.html&quot; title=&quot;Abjuration&quot;&gt;Abjuration&lt;/a&gt; ; &lt;b&gt;Niveau&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Barde.html&quot; title=&quot;Le barde&quot;&gt;Bard&lt;/a&gt; 1, &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Chaman.html&quot; title=&quot;Le chaman&quot;&gt;Cham&lt;/a&gt; 1&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Temps d&#39;incantation&lt;/b&gt; 1 &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Types-Dactions#Simple.html&quot; title=&quot;Action simple&quot;&gt;action simple&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Composantes&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Pr&#233;sentation-Des-Sorts#Composantes.html&quot; title=&quot;composantes&quot;&gt;V,G,M&lt;/a&gt; (une plume ou un objet repr&#233;sentant la chance)&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Port&#233;e&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Pr&#233;sentation-Des-Sorts#Portee.html&quot; title=&quot;personnelle&quot;&gt;personnelle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Cible&lt;/b&gt; Le lanceur de sorts&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Dur&#233;e&lt;/b&gt; 1 minute/&lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Vocabulaire-Courant#Niveau.html&quot; title=&quot;niveau&quot;&gt;niveau&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Vous vous impr&#233;gnez d&#39;une &lt;i&gt;b&#233;n&#233;diction de libert&#233;&lt;/i&gt;. Vous gagnez un bonus de chance de +1 par tranche de 6 niveaux de lanceur de sorts (minimum +1, maximum +3) &#224; votre &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Manœuvres-Offensives#Dmd.html&quot; title=&quot;DMD&quot;&gt;DMD&lt;/a&gt;, &#224; vos jets de sauvegarde contre les sorts et les pi&#232;ges qui entravent vos mouvements. Vous pouvez arr&#234;ter le sort par une &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Types-Dactions#Rapide.html&quot; title=&quot;Action rapide&quot;&gt;action rapide&lt;/a&gt; pour gagner un bonus de 1,5m (1 &lt;abbr title=&quot;cases&quot;&gt;c&lt;/abbr&gt;) &#224; votre &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Valeurs-De-Combat#Vitessededeplacement.html&quot; title=&quot;VD&quot;&gt;vitesse de base&lt;/a&gt; pour 1 round par minute restante avant l&#39;expiration du sort.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;box&quot;&gt;Blessing of Liberty
You imbue yourself with the blessings of liberty. You gain a +1 luck bonus per 6 caster levels (minimum +1, maximum +3) to your CMD and on saving throws against spells and traps that would move you or impede your movement. You can end the spell’s effects as a swift action to gain a +20 foot enhancement bonus to your base speed for 1 round per whole minute of duration remaining.&lt;/div&gt;
